      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t support SW KeyMint (or Keymaster) implementations except in test environments. Cuttlefish is even acquiring TEE-like implementation (running KeyMint in a separate process outside of CrosVM, using virtual TPM for key storage).",
